/T (For me that was John Snow \(not that one\) and his revolutionary work in Broad Street against cholera which led to an entirely new branch of medical science, epidemiology. I was fascinated for around a week before my interest and curiosity began to wander to numerous other topics such as the South Sea Bubble or the Punic Wars and before I knew it, I had buried myself in a dozen rabbit holes that nobody else knew I was down.)
/E (For me that was John Snow \(not that one\) and his revolutionary work in Broad Street against cholera which led to an entirely new branch of medical science, epidemiology. I was fascinated for around a week before my interest and curiosity began to wander to numerous other topics such as the South Sea Bubble or the Punic Wars and before I knew it, I had buried myself in a dozen rabbit holes that nobody else knew I was down.)
