/T (A reader will find the immune privilege of the human eye alongside the collapse of a bridge in Kyiv; two thousand years of calculating pi alongside the chemistry of a Kent hop field; superconductivity alongside a question about what an idea actually is. None of it was commissioned to fit a theme. It is what happens when you ask people what they actually find interesting and then hold them to a standard.)
