1141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 523 0 R
/E (Rising global energy demand and mounting concern over the environmental impact of fossil fuel use have driven a sustained shift towards renewable energy sources such as wind, solar photovoltaics, hydropower, and fuel cells. Although these technologies offer a low-carbon alternative to conventional generation, their output depends heavily on weather and other environmental conditions, which limits the ability of any single renewable source to provide a stable, continuous power supply.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1142 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 523 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
