/Pg 50 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
1443 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 542 0 R
/E (Antibiotics represent the most critical instruments of modern medicine; as essential prescription drugs, they often constitute life-preserving treatments. However, the non-prescribed use, unnecessary use, incorrect duration, and excessive use of antibiotics have significantly accelerated the development of AMR. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
1444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 542 0 R
/E (When antibiotics are administered, susceptible bacteria are eliminated, whereas antibiotic-resistant strains continue to proliferate; consequently, the antibiotic loses efficacy against these increasingly resistant populations \(Bala K.N.; Andrew D.N.\). )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
1445 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 542 0 R
/E (The main factors contributing to this phenomenon include inappropriate antibiotic prescribing and misuse, suboptimal treatment durations, excessive agricultural use, and inadequate hygiene and infection control measures \(WHO 2023\).)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
1446 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 542 0 R
/E (Furthermore, the misuse of antibiotics for viral infections such as the common cold, influenza, sore throat, bronchitis, and many sinus and ear infections is a major cause of AMR. Therefore, antibiotics should be used wisely \(Tuba D.\).)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
