1453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 543 0 R
/E (As a foundation of modern medicine, antimicrobial medicines are gradually losing their efficacy. The rise of drug-resistant pathogens threatens our ability to treat common infections and perform vital medical procedures, while also harming animal and plant health, reducing farm productivity, and jeopardising food security.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1454 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 543 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [6]
>>
