1732 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 559 0 R
/E (But behind the heritage and the hop gardens lies a body of chemistry as rich as any in the series. The bitterness of beer, the aroma of a freshly poured pint, the shelf life of an India Pale Ale shipped across oceans, all of these are determined at the molecular level, inside the tiny lupulin glands of the female hop cone.)
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
