1901 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 569 0 R
/E (Consider a scenario in which someone is handed a bottle of Sprite; the lid is already open, so there is no satisfying fizz from the crack of the seal. They raise it to their lips. Their brain has already decided that it will be sweet, fizzy and sharp. They drink. But it's water. They wonder if for a fraction of a second they tasted Sprite.)
/Pg 77 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
