/E (The bridge \(also called the Podilsko-Voskresenskyi Bridge\) was supposed to be a two-tiered structure that crosses the Dnipro and Desenka rivers in Kyiv \(Figure 2\). The main purpose of the bridge was to provide a metro level for the future Podilsko-Vyhurivska metro line.)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [6]
>>
