<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 575 0 R
/E (The bridge was planned as a 7.04 km crossing \(Suspilne Kyiv 2024\) that connects Naberezhno-Rybalska Road to Voskresensky Avenue, reducing the transit traffic on other bridges of Kyiv, and it is designed for about 59,000 vehicles a day \(Kyiv City Guide n.d.\).)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
