2038 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 575 0 R
/E (As of 2021, there were 7 road bridges across the Dnipro River in Kyiv, which formed 5 corridors for vehicles between the left and right banks of the capital \(Kravets 2021\). The significant importance of the Podilskyi Bridge lies in the Kyiv city plan. The Ukrainian capital originated on the right bank of the Dnipro River, and as the city developed, residential areas began to spread out to the left bank. )
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
