<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 576 0 R
/E (To alleviate this urgent issue, the Podilskyi Bridge was promised to be completed by the end of 2020 \(Kravets 2021\). Instead, the road level opened in stages: on 1 December 2023 for special vehicles and buses, on 1 December 2024 for cars and public transport, including the connection to Troieshchyna, and on 23 August 2025 for all lanes in both directions \(Interfax-Ukraine 2023; UNN 2024; UNN 2025\), while the metro level has yet to be built \(Liga.net 2025\). Problems with the contractor and a number of other factors delayed the work \(Kravets 2021\). The estimate of the funds needed has been rising for over 20 years: it grew from UAH 11.25 billion in 2016 to UAH 19.9 billion in 2021 \(Ekonomichna Pravda 2021\), about UAH 20 billion had been spent by 2025 \(Berezhanskyi 2025\), and one 2021 estimate put the total at over $950 million once exchange-rate differences over the construction period are counted \(Kravets 2021\). The rise was caused by the lack of constant long-term financing, contractor problems, and an annual budgeting process unsuited to a project of this scale \(Kravets 2021\).)
/Pg 84 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
