2058 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 577 0 R
/E (Moreover, the effect of induced demand \(Duranton and Turner 2011\) is likely to cause a major traffic inflow of private vehicles to the historic centre of the capital, moving the congestion from the North Bridge to the narrow streets of Podil. The idea of the priority of car transport ahead of public transportation generally contradicts the idea of sustainable urban mobility.)
/Pg 85 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
