2068 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 578 0 R
/E (As major funds were spent on this megaproject, the city was arguably unable to finance other infrastructural solutions, limiting the capability of the public transport grid and causing additional traffic jams on the roads. To conclude, large-scale infrastructure projects have to mainly focus on the needs of public transport, which is the main priority in modern-day metropolitan areas and, if ignored, may deepen the transport crisis. Additionally, it is vital to have a phased construction approach that delivers the core purpose of the project \(here, the metro level\) in the first phase, which will help prevent delays and further financial issues on such megaprojects. The completion of the bridge holds the potential for the Ukrainian capital, but only if it aligns with the sustainable urban mobility principles and prioritises public transport over private vehicles.)
/Pg 86 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
