2093 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 579 0 R
/E ( Heavy reliance on metro in Kyiv city has always been a major problem of the Ukrainian capital. The closure of a section of the Blue metro line clearly identified the inability of the city's public transport infrastructure to function without the metro system. The issue occurred due to both technological failure of the construction and the change in the geological situation underground, especially issues connected to the Lybid river basin. The problem has also been influenced by the urban sprawl and lack of distinct urban planning )
/Pg 87 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
