/P 579 0 R
/E (In early December of 2023, the Kyiv City State Administration announced the failure of a section of the subway tunnel on the Obolonsko-Teremkivska line between the Lybidska and Demiivska stations \(Ekonomichna Pravda 2023\). )
/Pg 87 0 R
/K [11]
>>
