/P 579 0 R
/E (Later on, the tunnelling shield was damaged by unknown structures under Demiivska Square; likewise, the water flow there was very high, and the shield was progressing forward at  a slow pace of around 1 metre per day. However, with the use of various waterproofing systems, from the construction of reinforced concrete structures protected by special rubber profiles to the use of external waterproofing with roll materials that are glued to the structures in several layers, the tunnel was finished)
/Pg 87 0 R
/K [14]
>>
