/P 580 0 R
/E (The tunnel's location within the Lybid River basin was a long-recognised risk factor, though this paper does not draw its own conclusion on foreseeability or fault, given that two named Kyiv Metro officials later faced criminal negligence charges over the incident. )
/Pg 88 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
2106 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 580 0 R
/E ( According to the Kyiv City State Administration and Kyivmetrobud, the subway specialists, who constantly monitor the condition of the tunnels, understood that such an accident could happen sooner or later \(Ekonomichna Pravda 2023\). One hypothesis links additional load on the tunnel lining to heavy urban sprawl in the area: major residential complexes and shopping malls under construction above the tunnel route may have added pressure, alongside hydrostatic pressure, contributing to cracking in the lining. Additionally, due to the failure of the sealing joints, some water leaked through the sand, damaging the outer walls of the tunnel. )
/Pg 88 0 R
/K [6]
>>
