/P 583 0 R
/E (The introduction of the internet and specifically social media has led to a hyper-visible world, where information, from impersonal broadcasts to individual beliefs and emotions, is made readily available to everyone through publicisation. )
/Pg 91 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
2146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 583 0 R
/E (This has produced the influx of negative data which our brains are required to process, as news of international conflicts, health crises and social injustices are reported on by both corporations and people. )
/Pg 91 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
