/P 583 0 R
/E (Consequently, this journalism produces great stress, resulting in phenomena such as vicarious traumatisation \(the process of being traumatised through observing another party being scarred\), along with the development of depression, anxiety and self-destructive behaviours within spectators.6)
/Pg 91 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
2149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 583 0 R
/E (Crucially, on an individual level, citizens are unrestrained in their reporting as they are not required to comply by publishing rules, allowing for emotions and personal perspectives to take precedence over the objectivity, displaying a biased and potentially inaccurate interpretation. )
/Pg 91 0 R
