2229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 587 0 R
/E ( The strongest objection is the market-rates argument: observed returns on capital reflect genuine social preferences, and the social planner should respect them. Goulder and Williams showed that the social welfare discount rate and the financial rate of return serve different functions and should not be conflated.30 Environmental policy requires the consumption rate of discount, not the opportunity cost of capital. Conflating them is a category error. )
/Pg 95 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
