/Title (Hello, I'm Elif Sude. I'm from Turkey, an A-level student interested in science, especially the scientific core beyond medicine, which has always been my favourite area to explore deeply. Through my research, I discovered that antibiotic resistance is not only critical to the future of medical treatments but also affects people at every stage of life. Recognising its far-reaching consequences, I felt compelled to explore this issue further and write an article to raise awareness and inform others about its importance.)
/Dest [99 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7040 0 R
/Prev 7886 0 R
